Water service may be provided from the county water system only following:
(1) Submission of a completed application, as well as all supporting documentation requested by the department director;
(2) Compliance with the provisions of this chapter, including, without limitation, the payment of all required fees and charges;
(3) Appropriate connection to the county water system and installation of a water meter as required by this chapter; and
(4) Determination by the county administrator that the requested provision of water services is feasible and consistent with sound water system operation. The owner of the property requesting water service shall submit plans, drawings, surveys, and other information as requested by the department director to assist the department director in making his determination under this section.
(Code 1987, § 13-5; Ord. No. 2013-007, § I, 12-3-2013)
